  "metadata_findings": [
    "12 existing INPUT associations copy the inputs of the global product (e.g. MIB2GEOP, MI1B2T, MI1B2E, MIRCCM, …); by rule 1c-1 they are not inputs of the subset, whose only parent is MIL2ASAE.",
    "3 associations give a version that CMR does not hold for that ShortName: MI1B2T '2' (CMR: ['003', '004']), MI1B2E '2' (CMR: ['003', '004']), MIRCCM '3' (CMR: ['004']).",
    "5 associations write the Version without the leading zeros CMR uses, so they do not resolve: MIB2GEOP '2' (CMR: ['002', '003']), MIANCARP '2' (CMR: ['002']), MIANCAGP '1' (CMR: ['001']), MIANACP '1' (CMR: ['001']), MIANTASC '2' (CMR: ['002']).",
    "4 associations name ShortNames that are not CMR collections: MIANLDBM, MIANSMT, MIANTOAC, MICNFG.",
    "No association to the global product it was cut from (MIL2ASAE).",
    "Linked page returns HTTP 404: https://asdc.larc.nasa.gov/citing-data",
    "Linked page returns HTTP 404: https://asdc.larc.nasa.gov/project/MISR",
    "Linked page returns HTTP 403: https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/spaceimages/details.php?id=PIA21927",
    "No document describes how the GoMACCS subsets were made (block range, orbit selection); the linked GoMACCS documents are an image gallery, a site list and a calendar.",
    "One collection version mixes two production software versions (F09_0019 for the first three orbits, F10_0020 for the rest); the record does not say so.",
    "The title and abstract call it a \"Level 2 TOA/Cloud Aerosol Product\"; it is the Level 2 Aerosol product (MIL2ASAE).",
    "Projects lists only 'MISR'; the GoMACCS campaign is not recorded as a project."
